+# Third-party audit
+
+Last reviewed: 2026-10-16
+
+| Dependency | Before | After |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Unsplash image CDN (hero photo) | Loaded from `images.unsplash.com`, leaking visitor IP and referrer | Self-hosted at `/assets/hero.jpg` |
+| `statikk` (via `pnpm dlx`) | Unpinned, downloaded at start, cannot set security headers | Removed; replaced by dependency-free `server.js` |
+| JS / analytics / fonts / cookies | None | None |
+
+Rules going forward:
+- The CSP is `default-src 'none'`. Any new third-party origin needs an explicit, reviewed CSP entry and an update to this file and the privacy policy.
+- Collect nothing unless a feature needs it; document it in `privacy-policy.html`.
+- Re-run `pnpm audit` / review the lockfile whenever dependencies are added.
