+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Privacy Policy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css">
+</head>
+
+<body>
+  <nav>
+    <div class="logo">THE DAILY GRIND</div>
+    <ul>
+      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
+    </ul>
+  </nav>
+
+  <main class="container policy">
+    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
+    <p>Last updated: 2026-10-16</p>
+
+    <h2>What we collect</h2>
+    <p>This website does not collect personal data. It has no forms, accounts, analytics, advertising or tracking, and it sets no cookies or local storage.</p>
+
+    <h2>Server logs</h2>
+    <p>Our server does not log IP addresses, user agents or URLs.</p>
+
+    <h2>Third parties</h2>
+    <p>All fonts, images and styles are served from our own domain. Your browser makes no requests to third-party services when you visit this site, and we send no referrer information.</p>
+    <ul>
+      <li>Hero photo: sourced from Unsplash, hosted by us under the Unsplash License.</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>Security</h2>
+    <p>We require HTTPS and apply a strict Content Security Policy and other browser protections.</p>
+
+    <h2>Changes</h2>
+    <p>Any new data collection will be added here before it starts, and will be limited to what is needed for the feature.</p>
+  </main>
+</body>
+
+</html>
